      "Ranks feature lists and summarizes quick wins, big bets, effort, and reach.",
      "Generates suggested quarterly roadmaps based on team capacity.",
      "Extracts interview pain points, feature requests, jobs to be done, sentiment, themes, metrics, and competitors.",
      "Provides PRD, agile epic, one-page PRD, and feature brief templates.",
      "Offers discovery, metrics, prioritization, stakeholder, and go-to-market frameworks."
    ],
